## Leave-off
- Fairy: ideas only in this file. Probes: `/tmp/s29c_ideas_rebuild_probe_*`,
  `/tmp/s29c_ideas_seed_*` (ephemeral; seed C has depth).
- DE owns isolate + link + I2; do not collide 6.1/2.10/R2 into the 2.9 ELF.
- Peers: ACCEPT only on a **new** BuildID; `ERR	type` is not refuse.
- Runtime: use the `s29c_runtime.oot` LPAREN-count gate on the new ELF.
- Hygiene: no ELF commit; do not clobber until smoke 0.
- Memory: isolate must not grow a join `args` string.

